{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-practical-roleplay-travel-to-guam-airport-to-hotel-by-taxi-or-hotel-shuttle-then-three/audio/main-5e66ece29a34.mp3","durationSec":113.424,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":3.06,"text":"You have your bags, and you are ready to leave Guam airport."},{"start":4.1,"end":6.38,"text":"The taxi counter is outside West Arrival."},{"start":7,"end":9.68,"text":"Tumon hotels are a short taxi ride from the airport."},{"start":10.56,"end":12.04,"text":"Ask about the fare before you leave."},{"start":12.88,"end":15.34,"text":"Taxis use meters, so do not guess the cost."},{"start":15.34,"end":18.28,"text":"A hotel transfer may be another choice."},{"start":18.96,"end":23.94,"text":"Many Tumon hotels offer courtesy airport transfers, but you need to confirm this when you book."},{"start":24.72,"end":26.3,"text":"Do not assume your hotel has one."},{"start":26.94,"end":30.22,"text":"Tell the driver your hotel name, and keep the address ready."},{"start":31.06,"end":35.92,"text":"A clear destination helps you begin the trip with less worry and enjoy your first conversation."},{"start":37,"end":39.52,"text":"After a flight, it is normal to need a little help."},{"start":40.34,"end":44.08,"text":"At Guam airport, car rental and tour counters are near baggage claim."},{"start":44.08,"end":46.98,"text":"Hotel phones are near the customs exit."},{"start":47.72,"end":50.78,"text":"These are different places, so name the service you need."},{"start":51.38,"end":54.68,"text":"If you want to contact your hotel, ask for the hotel phones."},{"start":54.68,"end":58.62,"text":"If you want a taxi, ask for the counter outside West Arrival."},{"start":59.54,"end":62.6,"text":"You can start with a simple question and explain your reason."},{"start":63.34,"end":66.66,"text":"For example, you may need to ask your hotel about a transfer."},{"start":67.3,"end":68.58,"text":"Thank the person who helps you."},{"start":69.1,"end":72.22,"text":"A short, friendly exchange can make arrival feel easier."},{"start":73.06,"end":77.4,"text":"Your airport trip ends when you reach your hotel, but another conversation begins."},{"start":78.4,"end":82.32,"text":"If you chose a taxi, remember that Guam taxis use meters."},{"start":83.18,"end":89.98,"text":"If you planned a courtesy transfer, remember that many Tumon hotels offer one, but confirmation matters."},{"start":90.76,"end":93.58,"text":"At the hotel, explain that you want to check in."},{"start":94.1,"end":96.1,"text":"Give the name on your reservation clearly."},{"start":97.22,"end":100.96,"text":"If you do not understand a question, ask the person to repeat it."},{"start":101.52,"end":103.58,"text":"You can also share why you are visiting."},{"start":104.22,"end":107.28,"text":"Perhaps you want a quiet holiday or time to explore."},{"start":108,"end":109.72,"text":"Keep personal answers simple."},{"start":110.08,"end":112.98,"text":"A friendly conversation can happen while you finish your arrival."}],"words":[{"text":"You","start":0,"end":0.18},{"text":"have","start":0.18,"end":0.38},{"text":"your","start":0.38,"end":0.54},{"text":"bags","start":0.54,"end":0.88},{"text":"and","start":0.88,"end":1.34},{"text":"you","start":1.34,"end":1.46},{"text":"are","start":1.46,"end":1.62},{"text":"ready","start":1.62,"end":1.8},{"text":"to","start":1.8,"end":2.06},{"text":"leave","start":2.06,"end":2.28},{"text":"Guam","start":2.28,"end":2.62},{"text":"airport","start":2.62,"end":3.06},{"text":"The","start":4.1,"end":4.12},{"text":"taxi","start":4.12,"end":4.46},{"text":"counter","start":4.46,"end":4.8},{"text":"is","start":4.8,"end":5.1},{"text":"outside","start":5.1,"end":5.56},{"text":"West","start":5.56,"end":5.86},{"text":"Arrival","start":5.86,"end":6.38},{"text":"Tumon","start":7,"end":7.24},{"text":"hotels","start":7.24,"end":7.7},{"text":"are","start":7.7,"end":7.96},{"text":"a","start":7.96,"end":8.12},{"text":"short","start":8.12,"end":8.36},{"text